</i></div>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Exporting the 3rd / 5th file, please do not close the page</span>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"progress-anat\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"track\"><div class=\"progress-anat-track\"></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:66%;z-index:1\"><div class=\"progress-anat-fill\"></div></div><div class=\"progress-anat-text\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\"><span>上传中…</span></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pct\"><span>66%</span></div></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"progress-anat\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"track\"><div class=\"progress-anat-track\"></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:66%;z-index:1\"><div class=\"progress-anat-fill\"></div></div><div class=\"progress-anat-text\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\"><span>Uploading...</span></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pct\"><span>66%</span></div></div></div></div>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"进度条本体","en":"Progress","desc":"整条组件，条形是最常见的形态","desc_en":"The entire component, strip is the most common form"},{"key":"track","cn":"轨道","en":"Track","desc":"灰色底槽，代表总量","desc_en":"The gray bottom slot represents the total amount"},{"key":"fill","cn":"填充","en":"Fill","desc":"已完成的部分，实时增长","desc_en":"The completed part grows in real time"},{"key":"label","cn":"状态文案","en":"Label","desc":"正在做什么，例如「上传中…」","desc_en":"What is being done, such as \"Uploading...\""},{"key":"pct","cn":"百分比","en":"Percent","desc":"具体数字，缓解等待焦虑","desc_en":"Specific numbers to ease waiting anxiety"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"条形","en":"Line","demo":"<div class=\"demo-progress\"><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill\" data-fill=\"66\"></div></div><div class=\"bar-text\"><span>上传中…</span><span>66%</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"demo-progress\"><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill\" data-fill=\"66\"></div></div><div class=\"bar-text\"><span>Uploading...</span><span>66%</span></div></div>","when":"默认形态，上传下载这类横向进度","when_en":"Default form, horizontal progress such as uploading and downloading"},{"cn":"环形","en":"Circle","demo":"<div class=\"progress-ring\"><i>66%</i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"progress-ring\"><i>66%</i></div>","when":"位置紧凑，或想突出百分比数字时","when_en":"When the location is tight or you want to highlight the percentage number"},{"cn":"成功状态","en":"Success","demo":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-success\" style=\"width:100%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">上传完成</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-success\" style=\"width:100%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">Upload completed</span></div>","when":"任务完成后保留最终进度并说明结果","when_en":"After the task is completed, keep the final progress and explain the results"},{"cn":"异常状态","en":"Exception","demo":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-error\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">网络中断，上传失败</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-error\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">Network interruption, upload failed</span></div>","when":"中途失败，停在出错位置并说明原因","when_en":"If it fails halfway, stop at the error location and explain the reason."}],"use":[{"t":"<b>文件上传 / 下载</b>：有明确总量，实时更新","m":"pg-upload"},{"t":"<b>多步骤任务</b>：新手引导、资料完善度","m":"pg-steps"},{"t":"<b>额度用量</b>：存储空间、流量套餐","m":"pg-storage"},{"t":"<b>后台批量任务</b>：导出、同步、批量处理","m":"pg-task"}],"dont":[{"t":"不知道总量：使用<b>不确定进度</b>，同时说明正在处理的任务","m":"pg-loading"},{"t":"任务很快完成：使用 {c:toast} 反馈结果","m":"pg-instant"},{"t":"展示多个分类占比时使用图表，单一完成度才使用进度条","m":"pg-donut"},{"t":"进度长时间不更新且没有状态说明：显示超时结果，并提供重试或取消","m":"pg-stuck","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"上传一个 200 MB 文件，而且系统知道已经传了多少。页面应该显示什么？","options":[{"id":"progress","label":"显示真实百分比或已上传大小，失败时提供重试","feedback":"对。任务总量和已完成量可测时，进度条能让用户判断还要等多久。","correct":true},{"id":"spinner","label":"显示“正在上传”和转圈动画，但不展示已经上传多少","feedback":"已有真实完成量时，Spinner 丢掉了用户可以利用的信息。","correct":false},{"id":"instant","label":"根据网速估算一个倒计时，用倒计时替代真实上传进度","feedback":"既然系统知道真实上传量，就应优先展示真实进度；网速变化会让估算倒计时反复跳动或提前结束。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A 200MB upload reports uploaded bytes. What feedback should be used?","options":[{"id":"progress","label":"Show real Progress percentage or uploaded size, with retry on failure","feedback":"Correct. When total and completed work are measurable, progress lets people judge the wait.","correct":true},{"id":"spinner","label":"Show only a continuously spinning Spinner","feedback":"When real completion exists, a Spinner loses useful information.","correct":false},{"id":"instant","label":"Immediately show upload complete while it continues in the background","feedback":"It presents incomplete transfer as success and can lead to data-loss assumptions.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"文件上传请使用真实已上传字节数更新 Progress，并显示百分比或大小；网络失败时保留可重试状态。上传一个测试文件并中断一次，确认进度随真实事件变化，失败不会被显示成完成。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use real uploaded-byte events to update Progress, showing percentage or size and retaining a retry state for network failure. Upload a test file and interrupt it once; confirm progress follows real events and failure is never shown as complete."}},"references":[{"title":"<progress> 进度指示元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/progress","title_en":"<progress>: The Progress Indicator element"}],"scenes":["文件上传进度","资料完善度","存储空间用量","批量导出任务"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"File upload","m":"pg-upload"},{"t":"Import or export","m":"pg-steps"},{"t":"Installation","m":"pg-storage"},{"t":"A task with measurable completion","m":"pg-task"}],"dont":[{"t":"Show a fake percentage when progress is unknown","m":"pg-loading"},{"t":"Leave a completed task stuck below 100%","m":"pg-instant"},{"t":"Use animation without a readable status","m":"pg-donut"},{"t":"Hide failure or cancellation behind the same loading state","m":"pg-stuck","bad":true}],"scenes":["Upload","Data import","Installation","Profile completion"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"progress-card\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📎 Homepage design draft.fig</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2.3 / 3.5 MB</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:66%\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\"><span>Uploading...</span><span style=\"color:var(--brand)\">66%</span></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"progress-card\" style=\"flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n      <div class=\"progress-ring\" style=\"background:conic-gradient(var(--brand) 0 80%, var(--bg-hover) 80% 100%)\"><i>80%</i></div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">Data completeness</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Upload your avatar to unlock all functions</span>\n        <span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;padding:0;font-size:12px\">To improve →</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"progress-card\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\"><b>Storage Space</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">6.2 / 10 GB used</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Photos 3.8 GB · Documents 1.6 GB</span>\n    </div>","<div class=\"progress-card\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\"><span>⬇ Export order data in batches</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">In progress</span></div>\n      <div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Exporting the 3rd / 5th file, please do not close the page</span>\n    </div>"],"distinctions":[{"label":"Spinner","text":"{c:progress} uses a track to show overall completion and can show a percentage when it is measurable. {c:spinner} usually marks a brief local wait with no known completion ratio.","targetId":"spinner"},{"label":"Steps","text":"{c:progress} shows continuous completion. {c:steps} names the stages so people know where they are in a process.","targetId":"steps"}],"variants":[{"demo":"<div class=\"demo-progress\"><div class=\"bar-track\"><div class=\"bar-fill\" data-fill=\"66\"></div></div><div class=\"bar-text\"><span>Uploading...</span><span>66%</span></div></div>","when":"Default form, horizontal progress such as uploading and downloading"},{"demo":"<div class=\"progress-ring\"><i>66%</i></div>","when":"When the location is tight or you want to highlight the percentage number"},{"demo":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-success\" style=\"width:100%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">Upload completed</span></div>","when":"After the task is completed, keep the final progress and explain the results"},{"demo":"<div class=\"progress-var\"><div class=\"progress-track\"><i class=\"progress-fill is-error\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div><span class=\"progress-note\">Network interruption, upload failed</span></div>","when":"If it fails halfway, stop at the error location and explain the reason."}]},"usageMocks":{"pg-upload":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">📎 设计稿.sketch</span><span s